1
00:00:39,648 --> 00:00:45,600
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,608
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,280
Didn't you want to meet

4
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,320
with the Merchant Coalition?

5
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:55,640
Now they've come to repay the favor.

6
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,240
They want to get close to Lizhi.

7
00:00:58,079 --> 00:00:59,560
I won't promise Lizhi's help.

8
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:01,840
All right.

9
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:04,640
By the way, look at these.

10
00:01:04,672 --> 00:01:05,728
(Silver Ledger)

11
00:01:05,728 --> 00:01:07,319
(Silver Ledger)

12
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:08,120
This one.

13
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:15,599
You've been busy these days,

14
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,560
gathering this evidence?

15
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:18,439
Well?

16
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,599
It's detailed

17
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:21,599
and well-organized.

18
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,879
The Yues can't deny it.

19
00:01:24,879 --> 00:01:26,239
Xingyao, you can

20
00:01:26,239 --> 00:01:27,560
finally stand on your own.

21
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,680
Of course.

22
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,599
I can't

23
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:35,359
stay under your wing forever.

24
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:36,879
Though,

25
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:38,560
I'm afraid in all of Daizhou,

26
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,640
no one would dare take this case.

27
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,079
Master Wei Xun dares to.

28
00:01:44,879 --> 00:01:46,840
Didn't you want to avoid him?

29
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:49,120
I didn't want him near Lizhi.

30
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,840
But last night,

31
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,280
I overheard something.

32
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:58,480
The young emperor does have some guts,

33
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:02,359
daring to send an imperial censor
into my domain.

34
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,400
And those useless fools

35
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,959
couldn't even handle
a simple matter like that.

36
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,520
So,

37
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,919
Prince Qi sent men
to kill the Merchant Coalition people?

38
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,879
His Majesty sent a censor here

39
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:14,159
to probe the General's Manor,

40
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,759
aiming to take this chance

41
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,680
to cut off Prince Qi's right-hand man.

42
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,319
The Merchant Coalition aided the censor

43
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,319
and was silenced
for uncovering something.

44
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,800
Master Wei Xun

45
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,360
has a capital accent

46
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,680
and was guarded by the Coalition.

47
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:27,800
I believe

48
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,120
he is the imperial censor.

49
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,719
We share one goal:

50
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,199
topple the General's Manor.

51
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,960
Once we're ready,

52
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,479
we'll pay Master Wei Xun a visit.

53
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:40,560
Right, there's also this.

54
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:46,439
Xingyao,

55
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:49,919
what's wrong?

56
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:55,000
(Xingyao's leg isn't limping anymore.)

57
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,120
Your leg...

58
00:02:58,759 --> 00:02:59,560
My leg?

59
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:05,560
Wangshu,

60
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,599
my leg doesn't hurt anymore.

61
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:13,639
It doesn't hurt at all anymore!

62
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,879
It's the herbal tea
you've been giving me, isn't it?

63
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:22,199
It's the Haichen Blooms
from the Loong Abyss.

64
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,719
The books say they're miraculous,

65
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,800
so I wanted to try.

66
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:27,159
But I didn't want to get your hopes up.

67
00:03:27,159 --> 00:03:28,439
I never thought it would work.

68
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:29,719
It's wonderful.

69
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,400
Thank you, Wangshu.

70
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,960
So silly.

71
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,240
(Though he never says it,)

72
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,920
(he craves warmth)

73
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,120
(and fears loneliness.)

74
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,439
Lizhi.

75
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,199
Try this.

76
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,879
How's my cooking

77
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,319
next to the imperial kitchen's?

78
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:57,504
It's good.

79
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,519
There's something I've wanted

80
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:02,639
to ask you.

81
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,639
Why did you

82
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:07,079
transfer my injury to yourself?

83
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,480
Couldn't you

84
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,439
just heal it directly?

85
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,079
I cannot do that.

86
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,360
So you can't do everything after all.

87
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,800
You can't only transfer

88
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,600
my injuries, can you?

89
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,279
That'd be way too weak.

90
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,560
Of course not.

91
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,279
I can transfer anyone's injury.

92
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:29,199
So you healed

93
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,399
Xingyao's leg,

94
00:05:32,319 --> 00:05:32,879
didn't you?

95
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,639
It was an old injury,

96
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,680
so it couldn't heal instantly.

97
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,959
So that's what you wanted to ask.

98
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,040
You asked all that on purpose,

99
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:43,680
didn't you?

100
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,759
Don't be a good man with no voice,

101
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,319
or people won't appreciate
what you've done.

102
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,920
You have to speak up,

103
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:56,680
so the one you care for will

104
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:57,959
care for you back.

105
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,079
Here.

106
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,360
What's this?

107
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,480
Look.

108
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,639
Is it fun?

109
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,000
It is.

110
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,480
Do you want something

111
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,000
even more fun?

112
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:56,079
There's more?

113
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,480
What is this?

114
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,279
Give me a hand.

115
00:07:13,568 --> 00:07:15,424
♪If the wind were a verb♪

116
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,360
It's beautiful.

117
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:21,263
♪Touching, then vanishing away♪

118
00:07:21,541 --> 00:07:24,164
♪Spreading throughout my heart♪

119
00:07:24,865 --> 00:07:29,204
♪I flipped when we met in our youth♪

120
00:07:30,583 --> 00:07:34,999
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

121
00:07:36,096 --> 00:07:38,240
♪If love were a noun♪

122
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:41,184
♪Woven with pain♪

123
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,160
Are you happy?

124
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:49,160
Want to be even happier?

125
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:59,362
♪Wherever our gazes meet,
passion settles♪

126
00:08:01,275 --> 00:08:04,235
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

127
00:08:04,235 --> 00:08:06,305
♪Take root after drowning♪

128
00:08:07,046 --> 00:08:12,448
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

129
00:08:12,608 --> 00:08:18,240
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

130
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:23,830
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

131
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:29,494
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

132
00:08:29,494 --> 00:08:35,127
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

133
00:08:35,127 --> 00:08:40,748
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

134
00:08:40,768 --> 00:08:50,132
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

135
00:09:25,919 --> 00:09:27,039
Wangshu,

136
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,679
I yearn for you so deeply,

137
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,960
yet you know nothing of it

138
00:09:32,639 --> 00:09:33,679
and treat me like this.

139
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,840
Are you doing this

140
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,679
just to upset me?

141
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:42,600
Young Lord,

142
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,879
a message from the capital.

143
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,480
Your father is tied up
with important affairs

144
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,240
and cannot leave

145
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:48,639
to attend your wedding.

146
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:49,399
Understood.

147
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,240
You may leave.

148
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,600
Young Lord,

149
00:09:52,679 --> 00:09:53,600
there's one more thing.

150
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:54,960
We can't find

151
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,840
any background on that man.

152
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:57,759
Moreover,

153
00:09:58,159 --> 00:10:00,879
he has always been
very close to Lady Wangshu.

154
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,759
Ready my horse.

155
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,104
Yes.

156
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:16,279
In such a hurry?

157
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,200
Where are you going,

158
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,919
Young Lord?

159
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:22,559
Qiyang?

160
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,799
What brings you here?

161
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:36,919
I came on behalf of my sister

162
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,919
to check on her groom.

163
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,799
Why do you look like
you've lost your soul?

164
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:46,120
Did Lingluo do something wrong

165
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,759
to displease you?

166
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,240
Of course not.

167
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:52,279
I'm just

168
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:53,960
a little tired.

169
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,799
Is that so?

170
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,840
I heard Prince Qi
is staying in the capital

171
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,919
and won't attend your wedding.

172
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,240
Lingluo already overthinks things.

173
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,200
Now she'll worry even more.

174
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,320
Young Lord,

175
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:26,480
the imperial court shifts by the minute.

176
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,159
The General's Manor

177
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:32,320
and Prince Qi's Mansion
stand and fall together

178
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:34,440
as our fates are bound.

179
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:37,720
If rumors of discord leak out now

180
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,000
and ruin His Highness's plans,

181
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:43,360
neither of us can bear the blame.

182
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:46,440
Tell me, Young Lord,

183
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,039
isn't that right?

184
00:11:53,679 --> 00:11:54,559
That said,

185
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:56,799
it's also my fault as an older brother

186
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:59,080
for failing to protect Yue Wangshu.

187
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:02,320
I know you're a man of sentiment,

188
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:05,240
so you must be hurting too.

189
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,080
I also heard

190
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,440
you sent men to look for her earlier.

191
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,840
Not at all.

192
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:15,240
I was just thinking,

193
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:18,279
if the Loong Lord
didn't take to Wangshu,

194
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,639
then...

195
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,919
But after days with no word,

196
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:24,320
I let it go.

197
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:27,960
I understand.

198
00:12:28,279 --> 00:12:30,120
I understand how you feel.

199
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,200
Get some rest.

200
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,320
I won't disturb you.

201
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:36,679
By the way,

202
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,879
as for Lingluo,

203
00:12:41,279 --> 00:12:42,879
you can't neglect her anymore.

204
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:46,080
She is my sister by blood, after all.

205
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:04,416
General.

206
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:08,480
Given his feelings for Yue Wangshu,

207
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,720
if he truly didn't know
whether she lived or died,

208
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,200
he would only be more frantic right now.

209
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:16,120
Yet seeing him so dazed like this,

210
00:13:17,759 --> 00:13:19,080
it's not that he didn't find her,

211
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,519
but because

212
00:13:21,159 --> 00:13:22,679
he has already seen her.

213
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,600
Yue Wangshu

214
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,720
is still alive.

215
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:27,919
In that case...

216
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:29,519
My investigation shows

217
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:30,200
that recently,

218
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,879
Lady Xingyao
and an unfamiliar young master

219
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:36,480
have been visiting
our land estates, pharmacies,

220
00:13:36,879 --> 00:13:37,879
and other businesses.

221
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,799
My dear sister

222
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,320
cheated death,

223
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:46,240
yet instead of hiding to stay alive,

224
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:48,039
she has the nerve

225
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,720
to return and undermine
our family's foundation.

226
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,879
She is truly

227
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,720
overestimating herself

228
00:13:58,759 --> 00:14:00,519
and courting death.

229
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,759
Look, it's completely healed.

230
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:07,320
That's wonderful.

231
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,840
Young Lord Zhu is getting married!

232
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,960
The General's Manor
is handing out lucky money!

233
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,240
Hurry up!

234
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:16,120
Young Lord Zhu is getting married!

235
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:18,039
General's Manor
is handing out lucky money!

236
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:18,960
Hurry up!

237
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,840
Wangshu, Zhu Heng
is getting married today.

238
00:14:21,159 --> 00:14:22,200
Let him marry.

239
00:14:22,919 --> 00:14:23,759
None of my business.

240
00:14:25,799 --> 00:14:27,240
We came here for serious business.

241
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:34,360
Are you not satisfied
with these, Master?

242
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:35,960
I have other wares.

243
00:14:36,159 --> 00:14:37,480
These won't do her any good.

244
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:38,840
Anything with characters?

245
00:14:39,104 --> 00:14:40,480
Come take a look!

246
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,720
Name carving here!

247
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:43,960
Engravings here!

248
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,720
Name carving here!

249
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,080
Would you like an engraving?

250
00:14:48,799 --> 00:14:49,759
Just carve your name

251
00:14:49,759 --> 00:14:51,720
and your beloved's
on this wooden plaque,

252
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,120
and hang it on the tree
before the Temple of Matrimony.

253
00:14:54,879 --> 00:14:56,159
It keeps love alive for life.

254
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,000
Pack up!

255
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,320
Pack up your stalls!

256
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,320
Pack up!

257
00:15:02,679 --> 00:15:03,679
Young Lord Zhu is wedding.

258
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:06,679
How dare you vendors
block the main street

259
00:15:06,679 --> 00:15:07,480
to do business?

260
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:08,639
Clear out

261
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:09,879
within two hours,

262
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,279
or you won't even live to do business!

263
00:15:14,039 --> 00:15:14,559
You're leaving?

264
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:17,080
Master, didn't you hear him?

265
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,480
Young Lord Zhu is wedding

266
00:15:18,759 --> 00:15:20,720
Lady Lingluo of the General's Manor.

267
00:15:20,879 --> 00:15:21,960
Even daring to cross Prince Qi,

268
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,360
Lady Lingluo of the General's Manor

269
00:15:23,559 --> 00:15:24,559
is still not to be crossed.

270
00:15:24,559 --> 00:15:25,399
Indeed.

271
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,320
Though the Young Lord

272
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,679
is betrothed to Lady Lingluo,

273
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,879
his heart was set on Lady Wangshu.

274
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,000
But then?

275
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,440
A dirty scheme,

276
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,519
and Lady Wangshu was offered up
as the Loong Consort.

277
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:39,679
To do that to her own sister...

278
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,240
Let's go. Come on.

279
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:45,440
(Loong Consort?)

280
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,879
(They mean her?)

281
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,960
Everything is ready. Let's go.

282
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:57,440
All dressed up.

283
00:15:57,639 --> 00:15:58,240
Where to?

284
00:16:01,759 --> 00:16:03,279
I'm seeing someone very important.

285
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:04,919
Wait for me at home, all right?

286
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,159
Go on, then.

287
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,480
Let's go.

288
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,799
(She's going to see him.)

289
00:16:21,856 --> 00:16:26,431
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

290
00:16:27,206 --> 00:16:31,703
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

291
00:16:34,942 --> 00:16:40,064
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

292
00:16:40,064 --> 00:16:43,403
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

293
00:16:43,403 --> 00:16:44,767
♪Refusing to forget♪

294
00:16:48,433 --> 00:16:53,210
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

295
00:16:53,761 --> 00:16:55,551
♪He cannot learn them♪

296
00:16:55,551 --> 00:16:58,686
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

297
00:17:01,838 --> 00:17:04,162
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

298
00:17:04,162 --> 00:17:06,525
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

299
00:17:07,103 --> 00:17:09,767
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

300
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:11,525
♪Their days ahead are long♪
